 Market","address":"400 N Carrollton Ave","city":"New Orleans","state":"LA","postal_code":"70119","stars":3.0,"review_count":111,"categories":["Food","Grocery"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"h6IzeUVASeDtvKhd2PEsKA","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":693,"mm_rank":723,"target_category_support_fraction":0.5,"selected_image_count":5,"label_diversity":2,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Grocery","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"h6IzeUVASeDtvKhd2PEsKA","review_id":"hzYRS9WPFV4NUoVRrWDjPA","date":"2014-09-08T06:00:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9453530311584473,"text_excerpt":"This is my neighborhood Rouses and i'm happy to call it that! There's always fresh produce at decent prices, friendly and helpful staff, far from a place i dread going. I've yet to try any of their food from the hot bar(s) but i've heard raving things over them. I can say however that if you've ever wanted to try Rouses sushi but have been apprehensive about it, i am here to let you know, it's official. Go ahead and go nuts, the sushi is bomb! Also don't sleep on their house-made chicken salad and their special roasted peanut butter (which can be found hidden inside a little fridge in the section with the weighted oats/nuts/etc.) I have a CostCo membership and that works out great at time..."},{"business_id":"h6IzeUVASeDtvKhd2PEsKA","review_id":"cGZaQ5FEeCAAc9Ob7FbDpQ","date":"2017-03-18T22:57:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9406219720840454,"text_excerpt":"I love rouses. They have the best meat section and great prices! I love to bring my out of town guest to Rouses so they can get their spices, coffee and other local favorites at the best prices. They make great souvenirs! Again, I love the marinated meats. Like butter injected Cajun seasoned chickens, Turduckens, creole and green onion sausage and stuffed everything with everything. It's also a goto during crawfish season. They tend to be a little spicer here for my Yankee palette but I still enjoy them. It's very convenient. I totally see why this market chain was voted the best in the USA by Epicurious Magazine. Good bakery department too!"},{"business_id":"h6IzeUVASeDtvKhd2PEsKA","review_id":"eOtOT-yUxPKvq38gpO74Dw","date":"2014-07-26T02:24:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9360949397087097,"text_excerpt":"This is my neighborhood grocery store. I love Rouses. They have a good selection of locally grown / made foods. When ever I couldn't find what I needed they've offered to try to order it for me. Their grill is pretty good and the burgers I find comparable to 5 guys. The snowball stand(?) is slow but never has a line (plus air conditioning!) so it's worth it to get your snowballs here rather than down the street."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"h6IzeUVASeDtvKhd2PEsKA","photo_id":"sobl8epyMIy0RLXEFT0ltA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/sobl8epyMIy0RLXEFT0ltA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8832395076751709},{"business_id":"h6IzeUVASeDtvKhd2PEsKA","photo_id":"TgbgLEV5UnpS0rtPcVaTzw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/TgbgLEV5UnpS0rtPcVaTzw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8673694133758545},{"business_id":"h6IzeUVASeDtvKhd2PEsKA","photo_id":"kPE1zjJ4XDQdD2wssXk6WQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/kPE1zjJ4XDQdD2wssXk6WQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7914944291114807},{"business_id":"h6IzeUVASeDtvKhd2PEsKA","photo_id":"8OJezwMT2tU7k7Q1bdabgQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8OJezwMT2tU7k7Q1bdabgQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.780762791633606},{"business_id":"h6IzeUVASeDtvKhd2PEsKA","photo_id":"IZoMVfrJd55QwcbzBuXrtQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/IZoMVfrJd55QwcbzBuXrtQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6759414672851562}]},"notebook_case":null}
